  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'STONE TEETH (Earth, the ''spikes'' form)

    Spikes run out along the ground ahead of you, one after another, in three rows.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot (   ). 30 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
  thing: {fileID: 1226536275}
  text: {fileID: 1364528720}
  back: {fileID: 312550144}
  shown: {fileID: 536738954}
  lineHeight: 0.17
  letterWidth: 0.075
