  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Clover.Runtime::Clover.World.StoneCard
  ShowWithin: 1.1
  LineLength: 38
  Words: 'GREAT BLIGHT (Poison, the ''bomb'' form)

    You stand rooted and raise a growing sphere, then throw it: a great burst and a burning patch.

    Press use (E) to wear it. Put it in a spell slot at a rest, then cast it with that slot (   ). 50 mana.

    Mana comes back by itself while a stone''s spell is worn.'
